OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy to start with
OL,6,Foccasional showers along the coast.
OL,7,FShowers likely to spread inland
OL,8,Fthrough the day, mostly light although
OL,9,Fthe odd heavier one possible further
OL,10,Fsouth. Breezy with temperatures near
OL,11,Faverage.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FVariable cloud with some
OL,14,Fclearer spells developing overnight,
OL,15,Fand becoming mostly dry. Chilly where
OL,16,Fany cloud breaks persist but generally
OL,17,Ffrost-free. Brisk coastal breeze,
OL,18,Flighter inland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
