OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FVariable, often large
OL,6,Famounts of cloud, still with isolated
OL,7,Fshowers possible but also some bright
OL,8,Fintervals. A brisk easterly breeze,
OL,9,Fespecially around the coast, giving a
OL,10,Fchilly feel.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FHigh
OL,13,Fpressure continues to dominate, often
OL,14,Fbringing cloudy conditions with a few
OL,15,Fshowers, and a brisk easterly breeze
OL,16,Fat times. Temperatures remain around
OL,17,Fnormal for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
